# SOURCED FILE — do not edit here. Edit automation/publish-data/ in the generator; this copy is overwritten on the next sync.
# The generator writes LF. Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites files to CRLF on checkout and
# every re-emit shows a diff for files whose content did not change — which destroys the property
# this repository depends on: that a data refresh reads as a reviewed diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
